OL,3,ATwo mass shootings in South Africa
OL,4,Aleave 27 dead
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwenty-seven people have been killed in
OL,7,Ftwo mass shootings hours apart in South
OL,8,FAfrica, the latest gun violence to hit
OL,9,Fthe country.
OL,11,FSeventeen people were killed when eight
OL,12,Fgunmen stormed a bar close to
OL,13,FJohannesburg on Saturday evening, with
OL,14,F15 more injured.
OL,16,FIn a separate shooting in the early
OL,17,Fhours of Sunday morning, 10 people were
OL,18,Fkilled outside an entertainment venue
OL,19,Fin a township near Cape Town and a
OL,20,Ffurther 11 were injured.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
