OL,3,ATwo mass shootings in South Africa
OL,4,Aleave 27 dead
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Africa has one of the highest
OL,7,Fmurder rates in the world and has
OL,8,Fstruggled to contain gang-related gun
OL,9,Fviolence in recent years. Police have
OL,10,Fnot given a definitive motive for
OL,11,Feither of the latest attacks.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
