OL,3,ATwo bodies found after avalanche hits
OL,4,AHimalayan climbing group
OL,5,
OL,6,FRescuers have recovered two bodies from
OL,7,Fthe site of an avalanche that struck a
OL,8,Fclimbing group camping in the Nepalese
OL,9,Fpart of the Himalayas.
OL,11,FAround a dozen people are still thought
OL,12,Fto be missing after a sheet of snow
OL,13,Ffell on the base camp of Himlung Himal
OL,14,Fpeak on Manang district on Sunday
OL,15,Fmorning.
OL,17,FThe group of Nepalese nationals,
OL,18,Fincluding climbers and support staff,
OL,19,Fhad been sent ahead of foreign climbers
OL,20,Fto prepare the camp and fix ropes.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
